        "XdawnTsLR",
        "xDAWN covariances → \\rightarrow shrinkage → \\rightarrow tangent space → \\rightarrow standard scaling → \\rightarrow logistic regression (CV-tuned C C )",
        "Classification: Evoked response and P300",
        "Rivet et al. (2009) , Barachant and Congedo (2014)"
      ],
      [
        "CovTsLR",
        "sample covariances → \\rightarrow shrinkage → \\rightarrow tangent space → \\rightarrow standard scaling → \\rightarrow logistic regression (CV-tuned C C ; one-vs-rest for multilabel)",
